// - d-generate_common_sidebar_recursive-     : Common method to generate recursive objects
// - d-generate_common_simple_array-          : Commom method to generate simple array
// - d-generate_common_simple_object-         : Commom method to generate simple object
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// - d-generate_common_langs_uri-     : Generate Langs respecting URI
// - d-generate_common_cookies-       : Generate Cookies Warning
// - d-generate_common_list-          : Generate Lists
